{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jhn-13-1","title":"John 13:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Jesus washes the disciples' feet, and exhorts them to humility and charity. 18 He foretells and discovers to John by a token, that Judas should betray him; 31 commands them to love one another; 36 and forewarns Peter of his denials.</p>\n<p>the feast. 6:4; Mt 26:2-5; Mr 14:1,2; Lu 22:1,2 knew. 7:6,30; 8:20; 11:9,10; 12:23; 17:1,11; 18:4; Mt 26:45; Lu 9:51 Lu 13:32,33; 22:53 depart. 3; 14:28; 16:5-7,28; 17:5,11,13 having. 34; 15:9,10,13,14; 17:9,10,14,16,26; Jer 31:3; Ro 8:37; Eph 5:25,26 1Jo 4:19; Re 1:5 unto. Mt 28:20; 1Co 1:8; Heb 3:6,14; 6:11; 1Pe 1:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-13-2","title":"John 13:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>supper. 4,26 the devil. 27; 6:70; Lu 22:3,31; Ac 5:3; Eph 2:3 put. Ezr 7:27; Ne 2:12; 2Co 8:16; Jas 1:13-17; Re 17:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-13-3","title":"John 13:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>knowing. 3:35; 5:22-27; 17:2; Mt 11:27; 28:18; Lu 10:22; Ac 2:36; 1Co 15:27 Eph 1:21,22; Php 2:9-11; Heb 1:2; 2:8,9 and that. 1; 1:18; 3:13; 7:29,33; 8:42; 16:27,28; 17:5-8,11-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-13-4","title":"John 13:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>laid aside.That is, his gown, or upper coat, [himatia,] with the girdle by which it was girdled close to his tunic, or inner coat; and instead of his girdle, he tied a towel about him, that he might have it in readiness to dry their feet,and that he might appear as a servant. Indeed the whole action was a servile one; and never performed by a superior to an inferior.</p>\n<p>Lu 12:37; 17:7; 22:27; 2Co 8:9; Php 2:6-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-13-5","title":"John 13:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>poureth. 19:34; 2Ki 3:11; Eze 36:25; Zec 13:1; Eph 5:26; 1Jo 5:6 to wash. 8; Ex 29:4; Le 14:8; 2Ki 5:10-13; Ps 51:2; Isa 1:16; Ac 22:16 1Co 6:11; Tit 3:3-5; Heb 10:22; 1Jo 1:7; Re 1:5; 7:14 feet. 10,12-14; Ge 18:4; 19:2; 1Sa 25:41; Lu 7:38,44; 1Ti 5:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-13-6","title":"John 13:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Peter. Gr. he. Lord. 1:27; Mt 3:11-14; Lu 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-13-7","title":"John 13:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>What. 10-12; 12:16; 14:26; Jer 32:24,25,43; Da 12:8,12; Hab 2:1-3 Jas 5:7-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-13-8","title":"John 13:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Thou shalt. Ge 42:38; Mt 16:22; 21:29; 26:33,35; Col 2:18,23 If. 6; 3:5; Isa 4:4; Eze 16:4-9; 36:25; Zec 13:1; Ac 22:16; 1Co 6:11 Eph 5:26; Tit 3:5; Heb 9:22,23; 10:4-10,22; Re 1:5; 7:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-13-9","title":"John 13:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>not. Ps 26:6; 51:2,7; Jer 4:14; Mt 27:24; Heb 10:22; 1Pe 3:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-13-10","title":"John 13:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>He. Le 16:26,28; 17:15,16; Nu 19:7,8,12,13,19-21; Heb 9:10; *Gr: needeth. Ec 7:20; Mt 6:12; Ro 7:20-23; 2Co 7:1; Eph 4:22-24; 5:26,27 1Th 5:23; Jas 3:2; 1Jo 1:7-10 but. So 4:7; Jer 50:20; 2Co 5:17,21 ye. 15:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-13-11","title":"John 13: